<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, raising fears of Ebola spread as patients flee treatment centres. The DR Congo military court sentenced 66 soldiers to death for cowardice in the eastern conflict. A report links gold smuggling to financing an Islamic State-linked insurgency in the region. Kabila has been accused of betraying South Africa over rebel links, while countries tighten travel restrictions and the Africa CDC calls for a humanitarian corridor to protect Ebola response. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/europe/europe-migrants-rwanda.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOY3hDQ29FQUxyUUVZV2RBUUFUX0RoUDhEUE40Y3p1VTZ0RTdNakF1QU9OOXkxaWQ1VUdRM09ETVdvaUgxeE1qTXJqSDkzUElaNW1NTmZDUFZ1TGw0bmhud3hDbjBpdjVLRVFLYTdSSHMtZ0tqNDhyRzZMM3FFdUdab21qLWNQek0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOMklzemtqRmozV3F4SFlXLWNpSUQ1TGU4YU9Yd08zWGpCSEJqdWIyYkhlM1hKVUpHUl9UajlqZmtJR1REeHVvZERiU1p6MndTM255SXJfdWhKeVpMY1JGRTliTEF5d1JlQnk4bFVQRE0yb3c3V3BibVVYLUxkQ1BobkhIZ0sxemhiVU1meVhqZXVjVVdl?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPWHJzNDd3MnpRT1pDRlVycEJ5aE40emNvNjl1dmNYVHVzbVNKVUl1WklMdm5ib0xCb1pPdXY2eFhoTGIyaDdpVi1lMmNqWVozRDlyUFBj